"</shortcut> <guimenu>खेल</guimenu> <guimenuitem>नव</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:111
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Starts a new game. It creates a random board using the current difficulty "
"level."
msgstr "नूतनं क्रीडां आरभते। वर्तमानकठिनतास्तरस्य उपयोगेन यादृच्छिकफलकं निर्माति ।"

#: index.docbook:118
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycap>P</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Pause</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycap>P</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>खेल</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>विरामं कुरुत</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:124
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pauses the game time. Click on the menu item again to make the game resume. "
"Note that the board disappears when the game is paused as it would be "
"unfair if you could search for good moves without the time pressure."
msgstr ""
"क्रीडसमयं विरामयति। क्रीडायाः पुनः आरम्भं कर्तुं पुनः मेनू-वस्तुं नुदन्तु । "
"ध्यानं कुर्वन्तु यत् यदा क्रीडायाः विरामः भवति तदा बोर्डः अन्तर्धानं भवति "
"यतः यदि भवान् समयस्य दबावं विना उत्तमं चालनं अन्वेष्टुं शक्नोति तर्हि "
"अन्यायः भविष्यति।"

#: index.docbook:131
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show High "
"Scores…</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>खेल</guimenu> <guimenuitem>उच्चाङ्कान् "
"दर्शयतु…</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:139
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shows a dialog containing the High Scores for the various difficulty levels."
msgstr "विभिन्नकठिनतास्तरस्य उच्चाङ्कान् युक्तं संवादं दर्शयति ।"

#: index.docbook:146
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>प्रश्न</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>खेल</guimenu> <guimenuitem>निवृत्तं</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:154
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Quits the program."
msgstr "कार्यक्रमं त्यजति।"

#: index.docbook:161
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycap>H</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Move</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Hint</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycap>H</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>चल</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>सूचना</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:167
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Highlight a diamond which can be moved."
msgstr "एकं हीरकं प्रकाशयन्तु यत् चालयितुं शक्यते।"

#: index.docbook:174
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Difficulty</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> <guisubmenu>कठिनता</guisubmenu>"

#: index.docbook:179
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lets you set the difficulty level from a sub-menu."
msgstr "उपमेनूतः कठिनतास्तरं सेट् कर्तुं शक्नोति ।"

#: index.docbook:180
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are five levels of difficulty:"
msgstr "कठिनतायाः पञ्च स्तराः सन्ति- १."

#: index.docbook:182
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Very easy</guimenuitem>: 12 rows, 12 columns, 5 types of "
"diamonds."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>अतिसुलभम्</guimenuitem>: १२ पङ्क्तयः, १२ स्तम्भाः, ५ प्रकाराः "
"हीरकाः ।"

#: index.docbook:183
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenuitem>Easy</guimenuitem>: 10 rows, 10 columns, 5 types of diamonds."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>सुलभ</guimenuitem>: १० पङ्क्तयः, १० स्तम्भाः, ५ प्रकाराः "
"हीरकाः ।"

#: index.docbook:184
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenuitem>Medium</guimenuitem>: 8 rows, 8 columns, 5 types of diamonds."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>मध्यम</guimenuitem>: ८ पङ्क्तयः, ८ स्तम्भाः, ५ प्रकाराः हीरकाः "
"।"

#: index.docbook:185
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenuitem>Hard</guimenuitem>: 8 rows, 8 columns, 6 types of diamonds."
msgstr "<guimenuitem>कठिन</guimenuitem>: ८ पङ्क्तयः, ८ स्तम्भाः, ६ प्रकाराः हीरकाः ।"

#: index.docbook:186
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Very hard</guimenuitem>: 8 rows, 8 columns, 7 types of "
"diamonds."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>अतिकठिन</guimenuitem>: ८ पङ्क्तयः, ८ स्तम्भाः, ७ प्रकाराः "
"हीरकाः ।"

#: index.docbook:192
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure "
"Notifications…</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> <guimenuitem>सूचनाः विन्यस्यताम्…</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:196
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This item displays a standard &kde; notifications configuration dialog, "
"where you can change the notifications (sounds, visible messages, &etc;) "
"used by &kdiamond;."
msgstr ""
"एतत् द्रव्यं मानकं &kde; notifications configuration dialog, यत्र भवान् "
"&kdiamond;द्वारा प्रयुक्तानि सूचनानि (ध्वनयः, दृश्यमानसन्देशाः & इत्यादयः) "
"परिवर्तयितुं शक्नोति ।"

#: index.docbook:202
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>,</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure &kdiamond;…</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>,</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> "
"<guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> <guimenuitem>&kdiamond;…</guimenuitem> "
"विन्यस्यताम्"

#: index.docbook:209
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Shows a dialog for choose a graphical theme for the game. Which themes are "
"available depends on the current installation. You may also download new "
"themes which have been created by third-party designers."
msgstr ""
"क्रीडायाः कृते चित्रात्मकं विषयं चिन्वन्तु इति संवादं दर्शयति । के विषयाः "
"उपलभ्यन्ते इति वर्तमानस्थापनस्य उपरि निर्भरं भवति । तृतीयपक्षस्य डिजाइनरैः "
"निर्मिताः नूतनाः विषयाः अपि डाउनलोड् कर्तुं शक्नुवन्ति ।"

#: index.docbook:214
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally &kdiamond; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> "
"and <guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for more information read the "
"sections about the <ulink "
"url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-settings\">Settings Menu</ulink> "
"and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-help\">Help "
"Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"अतिरिक्तरूपेण &kdiamond; सामान्यं &kde; <guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> तथा "
"<guimenu>सहायता</guimenu> मेनू-वस्तूनाम्, अधिकसूचनार्थं <ulink "
"url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-settings\">सेटिंग्स् मेन्यू< "
"इत्यस्य विषये विभागान् पठन्तु /ulink> तथा च &kde; मौलिकता।"

